    {
      "kind": "story",
      "key": "e6f8dd98eaba",
      "parent_key": "c22610245be0",
      "title": "Raise a card dispute",
      "lookup": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/Bank/_apis/wit/wiql?api-version=7.1",
        "body": {
          "query": "SELECT [System.Id] FROM WorkItems WHERE [System.TeamProject] = @project AND [System.Tags] CONTAINS 'sa-e6f8dd98eaba'"
        },
        "content_type": "application/json"
      },
      "create": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/Bank/_apis/wit/workitems/$User%20Story?api-version=7.1",
        "body": [
          {
            "op": "add",
            "path": "/fields/System.Title",
            "value": "Raise a card dispute"
          },
          {
            "op": "add",
            "path": "/fields/System.Description",
            "value": "<p>As a Customer, I want to dispute a card payment within 60 days, so that I get a temporary credit while the bank investigates.</p>\n<h4>Source</h4>\n<ul><li>Scenario: &quot;expects a temporary credit while the bank investigates&quot;</li><li>Question: How long does the customer have to raise a dispute? Answer: 60 days</li></ul>\n<p>Requirements: REQ-001, REQ-002</p>"
          },
          {
            "op": "add",
            "path": "/fields/Microsoft.VSTS.Common.Priority",
            "value": 1
          },
          {
            "op": "add",
            "path": "/fields/System.Tags",
            "value": "scenario-import; REQ-001; REQ-002; sa-e6f8dd98eaba"
          },
          {
            "op": "add",
            "path": "/fields/Microsoft.VSTS.Common.AcceptanceCriteria",
            "value": "<ol><li>Given a card payment made 10 days ago, when the customer raises a dispute, then a temporary credit is posted</li><li>Given a card payment made 90 days ago, when the customer raises a dispute, then the dispute is refused with the reason</li></ol>"
          },
          {
            "op": "add",
            "path": "/fields/Microsoft.VSTS.Scheduling.StoryPoints",
            "value": 5
          }
        ],
        "content_type": "application/json-patch+json"
      },
      "update": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "path": "/Bank/_apis/wit/workitems/{id}?api-version=7.1",
        "body": [
          {
            "op": "add",
            "path": "/fields/System.Title",
            "value": "Raise a card dispute"
          },
          {
            "op": "add",
            "path": "/fields/System.Description",
            "value": "<p>As a Customer, I want to dispute a card payment within 60 days, so that I get a temporary credit while the bank investigates.</p>\n<h4>Source</h4>\n<ul><li>Scenario: &quot;expects a temporary credit while the bank investigates&quot;</li><li>Question: How long does the customer have to raise a dispute? Answer: 60 days</li></ul>\n<p>Requirements: REQ-001, REQ-002</p>"
          },
          {
            "op": "add",
            "path": "/fields/Microsoft.VSTS.Common.Priority",
            "value": 1
          },
          {
            "op": "add",
            "path": "/fields/System.Tags",
            "value": "scenario-import; REQ-001; REQ-002; sa-e6f8dd98eaba"
          },
          {
            "op": "add",
            "path": "/fields/Microsoft.VSTS.Common.AcceptanceCriteria",
