          },
          {
            "op": "add",
            "path": "/fields/System.Description",
            "value": "<p>As a Compliance officer, I want every dispute action recorded, so that I can answer an audit.</p>\n<h4>Source</h4>\n<ul><li>Confirmed from saved memory (M-abc1234567): No daily claim limit</li><li>Decision on audit: Agent judgment, approved by the user</li></ul>\n<p>Requirements: REQ-003</p>"
          },
          {
            "op": "add",
            "path": "/fields/Microsoft.VSTS.Common.Priority",
            "value": 2
          },
          {
            "op": "add",
            "path": "/fields/System.Tags",
